sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as AI / MCP client
  participant S as APIM / Studio
  participant A as Parent API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  C->>S: Get job by ID
  S->>A: Get permitted job
  A->>D: Read job + safe result
  D-->>A: State + outcome
  A-->>S: Versioned response
  S-->>C: Job status / result
  Note over C,D: This is a new tool call.<br/>The original request is already complete.
